        <ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02026-1">
            <ns1:title>AI researchers reckon with the $1.5 million ‘academia tax’</ns1:title>
            <ns1:link>https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02026-1</ns1:link>
            <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature, Published online: 10 September 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02026-1"&gt;doi:10.1038/d41586-026-02026-1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Academics explain that their research freedom beats the increased salary they would get in the corporate sector, but emerging hybrid models might allow them to get the best of both worlds.</content:encoded>
            <dc:title>AI researchers reckon with the $1.5 million ‘academia tax’</dc:title>
            <dc:creator>Ben Deighton</dc:creator>
            <dc:identifier>doi:10.1038/d41586-026-02026-1</dc:identifier>
            <dc:source>Nature, Published online: 2026-09-10; | doi:10.1038/d41586-026-02026-1</dc:source>
            <dc:date>2026-09-10</dc:date>
            <ns4:publicationName>Nature</ns4:publicationName>
            <ns4:doi>10.1038/d41586-026-02026-1</ns4:doi>
            <ns4:url>https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02026-1</ns4:url>
        </ns1:item>
    
        <ns1:item rdf:about="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02821-w">
            <ns1:title>Ruins of ancient Asian city show engineering prowess and organization</ns1:title>
            <ns1:link>https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02821-w</ns1:link>
            <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature, Published online: 09 September 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02821-w"&gt;doi:10.1038/d41586-026-02821-w&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;The 5,000-year-old city of Liangzhu has mounds, dams and city walls built in a challenging waterlogged site.</content:encoded>
            <dc:title>Ruins of ancient Asian city show engineering prowess and organization</dc:title>
            
            <dc:identifier>doi:10.1038/d41586-026-02821-w</dc:identifier>
            <dc:source>Nature, Published online: 2026-09-09; | doi:10.1038/d41586-026-02821-w</dc:source>
            <dc:date>2026-09-09</dc:date>
